Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 01:28:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 11/14] packaging: prepare opt-in DisplayID API as hdr4

Regenerate the focused quilt patch from the unchanged Ubuntu baseline, keeping historical upstream and local proposed provenance distinct. Preserve the old high-level contract and four additive symbol floors. Set Ubuntu vendor Maintainer metadata while retaining original Debian attribution.
---
 debian/changelog                          |   1 +
 debian/control                            |   3 +-
 debian/patches/native-displayid-hdr.patch | 490 ++++++++++++++--------
 3 files changed, 318 insertions(+), 176 deletions(-)

