+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 libdisplay-info (0.3.0-1ubuntu1~hdr4) stonking; urgency=medium
 
+  * Use Ubuntu vendor Maintainer metadata, preserving original attribution.
   * Add four proposed parsed DisplayID2 getters/types for explicit native
     capability consumers, with matching runtime/development dependencies.
   * Restore native-only defaults in both legacy HDR/colorimetry getters;
